{"id":"654829","name":"豉油皇焖鸡","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/654829/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"三黄鸡","amount":"半只"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蒜头","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:三黄鸡半只先用热水冲洗干净。","img":"images/654829/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"姜，蒜。","img":"images/654829/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豉油油鸡爪汁。","img":"images/654829/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡用厨房纸吸干水分后用酱油抹均匀腌制20分钟。","img":"images/654829/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热锅放油。","img":"images/654829/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将鸡两面都煎制一会儿。","img":"images/654829/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入姜蒜爆出香味。","img":"images/654829/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"添加适量的豉油皇酱汁。","img":"images/654829/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"添加适量的水大火烧开。","img":"images/654829/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"两面都翻动一下。","img":"images/654829/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"调小火盖上盖子焖煮25分钟左右中途需翻面。","img":"images/654829/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"时间到了打开盖子色泽很不错。","img":"images/654829/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"稍微调大点火把酱汁淋在鸡表面让色泽更红亮。","img":"images/654829/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"然后稍微放凉。","img":"images/654829/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"斩件装盘。","img":"images/654829/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再淋上锅里的酱汁就可以上桌啦。","img":"images/654829/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/654829/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/654829/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}